{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Knock On The Window</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knock on the Window</strong> is an atmospheric horror with a VHS aesthetic that will immerse you in a mysterious story full of suspense and unexpected twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520030/extras/7e1e1d41e84d27f6abfd84c5ac83b6e0.poster.avif?t=1764596150\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520030/extras/7e1e1d41e84d27f6abfd84c5ac83b6e0.webm?t=1764596150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martin has been given an urgent assignment at work. However, for this he had to go to the house of his Boss. And so Martin found himself alone at home, in the middle of a vast field of sunflowers. Everything was going well until there was a knock on the window....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520030/extras/ca421728f25bedea297864e1ed4f1d6b.poster.avif?t=1764596150\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520030/extras/ca421728f25bedea297864e1ed4f1d6b.webm?t=1764596150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock on the Window is a walking simulator with a variety of mechanics, allowing you to explore many atmospheric locations. The detailed environments, muted tones and VHS aesthetics create a feeling of total immersion, as if you were part of an 80's horror movie. Every sound, every shadow could be hiding something sinister....</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse locations with unique details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS visual style, immersing you in retro horror aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling plot with unexpected twists and turns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520030?t=1764596150","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764596150","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520030/88b66d44b319bd7b400e59250333f8692a149a04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764596150","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520030/88b66d44b319bd7b400e59250333f8692a149a04/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764596150","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Knock On The Window</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knock on the Window</strong> is an atmospheric horror with a VHS aesthetic that will immerse you in a mysterious story full of suspense and unexpected twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520030/extras/7e1e1d41e84d27f6abfd84c5ac83b6e0.poster.avif?t=1764596150\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520030/extras/7e1e1d41e84d27f6abfd84c5ac83b6e0.webm?t=1764596150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martin has been given an urgent assignment at work. However, for this he had to go to the house of his Boss. And so Martin found himself alone at home, in the middle of a vast field of sunflowers. Everything was going well until there was a knock on the window....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520030/extras/ca421728f25bedea297864e1ed4f1d6b.poster.avif?t=1764596150\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520030/extras/ca421728f25bedea297864e1ed4f1d6b.webm?t=1764596150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock on the Window is a walking simulator with a variety of mechanics, allowing you to explore many atmospheric locations. The detailed environments, muted tones and VHS aesthetics create a feeling of total immersion, as if you were part of an 80's horror movie. Every sound, every shadow could be hiding something sinister....</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse locations with unique details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS visual style, immersing you in retro horror aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling plot with unexpected twists and turns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Tropical Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520030/e9a20e9a9ab102b11878cf0f8824bc5c5ac9f6df/header.jpg?t=1764596150","is_free":false,"li